  /**
   * Batch update runtime settings stored in discussion_board_settings
   * (DiscussionBoardSetting).
   *
   * Update multiple runtime configuration entries used by the application. This
   * operation allows privileged actors to change the `value` and `is_active`
   * state of one or more settings. Inputs reference the `key` column of the
   * Prisma model discussion_board_settings and MUST not attempt to modify
   * columns that are not part of the model (for example, direct modification of
   * `id`, `created_at` should be avoided by clients).
